{"id":"n62493-2-6","stage":1,"title":"가까이 · 近","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62493-2-6-1","ko":"물고기는 몇 마리나 낚았습니까?","zh":"钓到了几条鱼呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"물고기는","meaning":"鱼","explanation":"물고기：鱼；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"물고기","audio":"/audio/83844ff2a2ce50f87e1d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56181","senseId":"1","lemma":"물고기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몇","meaning":"几，多少","explanation":"몇：几，多少","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"2","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마리나","meaning":"只，头，条","explanation":"마리：只，头，条；나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"마리","audio":"/audio/1338676ef4cf144fb5fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51771","senseId":"1","lemma":"마리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"낚았습니까?","meaning":"钓","explanation":"낚다：钓；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；습니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"낚다","audio":"/audio/9b5257bf1b5e8edc6c37.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56097","senseId":"1","lemma":"낚다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"83844ff2a2ce50f8","term":"물고기","zh":"鱼","audio":"/audio/83844ff2a2ce50f87e1d.mp3","entryId":"56181","definition":"一种脊椎动物，生活在水中，有鳃、鳍和鳞片。","pronunciation":["물꼬기"]},{"id":"37ca98883f5001d4","term":"몇","zh":"几，多少","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3","entryId":"66235","definition":"用于询问不知道的数目。","pronunciation":["멷"]},{"id":"1338676ef4cf144f","term":"마리","zh":"只，头，条","audio":"/audio/1338676ef4cf144fb5fa.mp3","entryId":"51771","definition":"计算飞禽走兽或鱼虫等的数量单位。","pronunciation":["마리"]},{"id":"9b5257bf1b5e8edc","term":"낚다","zh":"钓","audio":"/audio/9b5257bf1b5e8edc6c37.mp3","entryId":"56097","definition":"用鱼钩或渔网捕鱼。","pronunciation":["낙따"]}],"audio":"/audio/2b5a6c8c45ffffbdc248.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62493-2-6-2","ko":"두 시간 가까이를 앉아 있었지만 한 마리도 못 낚았습니다.","zh":"虽然坐了将近两个小时，却一条都没钓到。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句