完成，常与词干缩合。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"낚다","audio":"/audio/9b5257bf1b5e8edc6c37.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56097","senseId":"1","lemma":"낚다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"dfedd225bb659d50","term":"두","zh":"两","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3","entryId":"71458","definition":"两个的。","pronunciation":["두ː"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"小时","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62842","definition":"时间单位。表示一天的二十四分之一时长。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"3eda613a715239a7","term":"가까이","zh":"近，附近，左右","audio":"/audio/3eda613a715239a71379.mp3","entryId":"62493","definition":"接近某个标准。","pronunciation":["가까이"]},{"id":"17e77d3fb6b2dbdb","term":"앉다","zh":"坐","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3","entryId":"71463","definition":"挺直上半身，将臀部置于别的物体或地上以支持身体的重量。","pronunciation":["안따"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"一个的。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"1338676ef4cf144f","term":"마리","zh":"只，头，条","audio":"/audio/1338676ef4cf144fb5fa.mp3","entryId":"51771","definition":"计算飞禽走兽或鱼虫等的数量单位。","pronunciation":["마리"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"9b5257bf1b5e8edc","term":"낚다","zh":"钓","audio":"/audio/9b5257bf1b5e8edc6c37.mp3","entryId":"56097","definition":"用鱼钩或渔网捕鱼。","pronunciation":["낙따"]}],"audio":"/audio/9da15558322fef35f948.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.635,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62493","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":48,"sequenceScore":2.11